This is 4va, the 4th dimensional graphics viewer for X-Windows.
Please see the man page "doc/4va.1" for details (to format it, use
the command "nroff -man doc/4va.1 | ul").

Build with "meson setup build && meson compile -C build". Sample
object files are in data/, e.g. "build/4va data/hcube.4vd".

Please send any questions or bugs to mdw1@crux2.cit.cornell.edu.

Share and Enjoy!
Matt Welsh
